'''Dark Vortex''' is a [[debuff]] that can be found in the boss fight of [[Dusk, Harbinger of Lunaris]] (and its map variant), as well as the boss fight of [[Solaris and Lunaris]] (and its map variant).

In the first fight, [[Lunaris, Eternal Moon]], in the Celestial Form (or known as "orb form"), is suspended in the centre of the boss arena, and occasionally casts a vortex that inflicts "Dark Vortex" debuff when stepped on.

While in the second fight, after damaging [[Lunaris, Eternal Moon]] to a certain health remaining, Lunaris will return to its orb form and cast Dark Vortex to aid [[Solaris, Eternal Sun]].

The debuff can also be found in the map variant of the boss fight in {{il|Moon Temple Map}}<ref>[[Monster:Metadata/Monsters/LunarisSolaris/LunarisCelestialFormDuskMap]]</ref> and {{il|The Twilight Temple}}<ref>[[Monster:Metadata/Monsters/LunarisSolaris/LunarisCelestialFormUniqueMap]]</ref> (the pressure plate mini-boss fight and when selecting [[Selenia, the Endless Night]] as final map boss).
